      "text": "Transform environment: take the first 3 characters and uppercase them. Transform service: lowercase the entire string and replace each space with a hyphen. Transform version: prefix with 'v' and zero-pad the integer to 4 digits on the left. Concatenate the three segments with '::'. Write the result as a compact JSON object with key \"deployment_key\" to deployment-key.json, followed by one LF newline. Then output done message exactly \"deployment key created\". Enforce that all model replies contain valid JSON only, with no surrounding text; the action sequence must be read, then write, then done in that exact order; do not stop before the done action; do not leave the deployment_key value empty or untransformed."
